# ===========================================================
#  .dockerignore — keeps the build context small and secret-free
# ===========================================================
# TWO patterns here are load-bearing and were previously wrong:
#
#  1. `node_modules` alone only matches the context ROOT. The repo also has
#     server/node_modules (~600MB, Windows-installed). `COPY server/ ./server/`
#     therefore baked 612 host-installed packages into the image, shadowing the
#     locked Alpine deps from `npm ci`. Non-reproducible builds + wrong native
#     binaries. -> `**/node_modules`
#
#  2. `.env` alone also only matches the ROOT, so `server/.env` was copied into
#     the image with live JWT_SECRET / SESSION_SECRET / SECRETS_KEY /
#     DATABASE_URL. -> `**/.env*`
#
# (git's .gitignore has no such anchoring, which is why only Docker was affected.)

# ---- dependencies (installed fresh inside the image) ----
**/node_modules
**/.npm
**/.yarn
npm-debug.log*

# ---- secrets: never enter a layer ----
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/login.json
**/test-login.json
**/.srvcred.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# ---- VCS / OS ----
.git
.gitignore
.gitmodules
.github
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- local runtime state / generated data (NESTED too) ----
# Same anchoring trap as node_modules and .env above: `logs/` and
# `backup-archive/` only match the repo root, so `server/logs/` and
# `server/backup-archive/` were still copied in — 410MB of real JSON database
# backups (customers/sales) plus a 20MB access log ended up inside the
# production image, alongside a 13.5MB developer SQLite DB. Business data must
# never ship in an image layer. store.mjs and routes/backup.mjs both call
# mkdirSync(recursive), so these directories are recreated at runtime.
server/data/
server/logs/
server/backup-archive/
server/backup7/
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/backup-archive/
**/backups/
**/backup*.json
coverage/
out/
dist/
build/
.cache/

# ---- large dirs not needed to build or run the app ----
deploy_pkg/
tools/
android/
api/
control/
_backup_src_before_identity/
.backup_src_before_identity/
_backup_src_before_identity/
docs/

# ---- docs/archives ----
*.md
!README.md
*.tar
*.zip
*.7z